<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῡμο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high-spirited</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθυμος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				456a
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργίλος</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				411c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>passionate, hot-tempered</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραΰς</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				375c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of horses,
				<i>mettled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.1.3
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπειθέστατος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλακωδέστερος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Philos.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θ</span>. <i>spirit, passion</i>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λογιστικόν, τὸ
			ἐπιθυμητικόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				440e
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				3.67
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					4.3.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
